"Authority" = "颁发机构";
"Couldn’t review the certificate" = "无法检查证书";
"Different authority" = "不同的颁发机构";
"Expires" = "到期";
"Portbase saves the authority in this device’s Keychain and switches this connection to TLS Required (Private CA). Certificates and hostnames are still verified on every connection, and a different authority will be refused." = "Portbase 会将该颁发机构保存到此设备的钥匙串，并将此连接切换为“必须使用 TLS（私有 CA）”。每次连接仍会验证证书和主机名，不同的颁发机构将被拒绝。";
"Replace and Connect" = "替换并连接";
"Review Certificate" = "检查证书";
"SHA-256 fingerprint" = "SHA-256 指纹";
"TLS Required (Ask to Trust New CAs)" = "必须使用 TLS（新 CA 需确认）";
"The certificate is signed by an authority this device doesn’t trust, as with managed databases that use their own CA. Review the server’s certificate to trust its authority for this connection." = "该证书由此设备不信任的颁发机构签名，使用自有 CA 的托管数据库常见这种情况。检查服务器证书即可为此连接信任其颁发机构。";
"The server didn’t complete the TLS handshake in time." = "服务器未及时完成 TLS 握手。";
"The server didn’t present a certificate." = "服务器未提供证书。";
"The server didn’t send its certificate authority. Import the CA certificate from your database provider instead." = "服务器未发送其证书颁发机构。请改为导入数据库提供商的 CA 证书。";
"The server doesn’t offer TLS, so there’s no certificate to review." = "服务器不提供 TLS，因此没有可检查的证书。";
"The server presented a certificate from an authority this device doesn’t trust. Managed databases such as DigitalOcean, Amazon RDS, and Azure sign certificates with their own CA. Trust it only if you expected to connect to this server." = "服务器出示了一个由此设备不信任的颁发机构签发的证书。DigitalOcean、Amazon RDS 和 Azure 等托管数据库会使用自有 CA 签发证书。仅在你确实要连接此服务器时才信任它。";
"The server refused the connection." = "服务器拒绝了连接。";
"The server’s certificate authority changed" = "服务器的证书颁发机构已更改";
"The server’s certificate doesn’t list %@, so trusting this authority won’t fix the connection. Connect with a hostname the certificate names." = "服务器证书中没有 %@，因此信任此颁发机构无法解决连接问题。请使用证书中列出的主机名连接。";
"The server’s certificate isn’t valid now (it expires or expired on %@). Renew it on the server, or check this device’s date and time." = "服务器证书当前无效（到期时间：%@）。请在服务器上续签，或检查此设备的日期和时间。";
"This connection already trusts another certificate authority. Replace it only if your provider rotated its CA." = "此连接已信任另一个证书颁发机构。仅在提供商更换了 CA 时才替换。";
"This connection type doesn’t use server certificates." = "此连接类型不使用服务器证书。";
"Trust and Connect" = "信任并连接";
"Trust this server’s certificate authority?" = "要信任此服务器的证书颁发机构吗？";
"Unnamed authority" = "未命名的颁发机构";
"When a server uses its own certificate authority, as managed databases often do, Portbase shows it on the first connection and asks before trusting it for this connection." = "当服务器使用自有证书颁发机构时（托管数据库常这样做），Portbase 会在首次连接时显示它，并在为此连接信任它之前征求确认。";
"This connection already trusts the server’s certificate authority, so the connection failed for another reason. Check the connection details." = "此连接已信任服务器的证书颁发机构，因此失败另有原因。请检查连接详情。";
"TLS remains required. The server certificate must chain to this private CA, and the hostname is still verified." = "仍需使用 TLS。服务器证书必须链接到此私有 CA，主机名也仍会验证。";
